<title>NORWAY: Storebrand and Kreditkassen confirm merger.</title>
<headline>Storebrand and Kreditkassen confirm merger.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwegian insurance company Storebrand and Norwegian bank Kreditkassen, known as Christiania Bank, on Wednesday confirmed plans to merge.</p>
<p>THey said they will hold a joint press conference at 0800 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Oslo newsroom +47-22-42 50 41</p>
